{"seq":2,"slug":"3d-modeling-animation","title":"三维建模与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation/3d-modeling-animation","wordCount":1864,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"三维建模与动画\">三维建模与动画</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"三维建模基础概念\">三维建模基础概念</h3><p>三维建模是将概念设计转化为数字三维资产的过程，是影视特效、游戏开发、工业设计、建筑可视化等领域的核心生产环节。</p>\n<p><strong>三维坐标系与变换</strong>：</p>\n<p>三维空间中的物体通过变换矩阵进行操控。基本变换包括平移（Translation）、旋转（Rotation）和缩放（Scale），统称 TRS 变换。在齐次坐标系中，一个点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y, z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的变换可表示为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>y</mi></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>z</mi></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{bmatrix} x&#x27; \\\\ y&#x27; \\\\ z&#x27; \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix} = M_{TRS} \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\\\ z \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.8em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:4.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"4.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 4800\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v1200 v1759 h347 v-84\nH403z M403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v1200 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:4.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"4.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 4800\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v1200 v1759 H0 v84 H347z\nM347 1759 V0 H263 V1759 v1200 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.8em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:4.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"4.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 4800\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v1200 v1759 h347 v-84\nH403z M403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v1200 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:4.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"4.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 4800\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v1200 v1759 H0 v84 H347z\nM347 1759 V0 H263 V1759 v1200 v1759 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{TRS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 的复合变换矩阵。理解矩阵变换的顺序依赖性（缩放→旋转→平移）是避免常见错误的关键。</p>\n<p><strong>建模方法论</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多边形建模（Polygon Modeling）</strong>：使用顶点、边、面构建网格。适合硬表面建模（机械、建筑）。核心操作：挤出（Extrude）、环切（Loop Cut）、倒角（Bevel）、桥接（Bridge）。</li>\n<li><strong>NURBS 建模</strong>：非均匀有理 B 样条曲面，适合光滑曲面（汽车、工业产品）。控制点通过权重影响曲面形态。</li>\n<li><strong>数字雕刻（Digital Sculpting）</strong>：高面数直接雕刻，模拟黏土塑形过程。ZBrush/Blender Sculpt Mode 支持数百万面的实时雕刻，适合角色与生物有机体。</li>\n<li><strong>程序化建模</strong>：通过节点图或脚本规则生成几何体。Houdini 的 SOP 网络是程序化建模的行业标准，适合城市场景、自然环境等大规模资产生成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"拓扑与uv展开\">拓扑与UV展开</h3><p>拓扑（Topology）指网格的线框结构方式，直接影响动画变形质量与渲染效率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四边面优先</strong>：四边面（Quad）在细分时保持均匀，是动画模型的黄金标准</li>\n<li><strong>布线走向</strong>：边循环（Edge Loop）应顺着肌肉走向和关节弯曲方向分布</li>\n<li><strong>极点控制</strong>：五星极点（5-pole）和三星极点（3-pole）应安置在不参与大幅变形的区域</li>\n<li><strong>面数控制</strong>：实时渲染（游戏）单角色一般控制在 10K-100K 面；影视离线渲染可用数百万面</li>\n</ul>\n<p>UV展开是将三维模型表面&quot;拆解&quot;为二维平面贴图的过程，关键在于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最小化拉伸畸变（Stretch）</li>\n<li>合理放置接缝（Seam）在不可见区域</li>\n<li>最大化UV空间利用率（Texel Density 一致性）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;概念设计&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;基础建模&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;拓扑优化&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;UV 展开&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;材质贴图&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;骨骼绑定&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;动画制作&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;渲染输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"概念设计\"] --&gt; B[\"基础建模\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"拓扑优化\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"UV 展开\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"材质贴图\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"骨骼绑定\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"动画制作\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"渲染输出\"]</pre><h3 id=\"材质与贴图系统\">材质与贴图系统</h3><p>PBR（Physically Based Rendering）材质系统是当代三维渲染的标准：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Base Color（基础色）</strong>：物体固有色，不包含光照信息</li>\n<li><strong>Metallic（金属度）</strong>：0=非金属（电介质），1=金属。决定反射行为差异</li>\n<li><strong>Roughness（粗糙度）</strong>：0=完美镜面，1=完全漫反射。微表面散射程度</li>\n<li><strong>Normal Map（法线贴图）</strong>：用 RGB 值编码表面法线偏移方向，在不增加几何面数的前提下模拟表面细节</li>\n<li><strong>Ambient Occlusion（环境遮蔽）</strong>：预计算缝隙处的光线遮挡程度，增强空间层次感</li>\n</ul>\n<p>贴图制作工具链：Substance Painter（手绘贴图）→ Substance Designer（程序化材质）→ 引擎中实时预览。</p>\n<h3 id=\"骨骼绑定与角色动画\">骨骼绑定与角色动画</h3><p>角色动画的前提是完善的骨骼绑定系统（Rig）：</p>\n<p><strong>骨骼层级</strong>：从根骨骼（Hips）出发，通过父子关系构建完整骨架。人形角色通常包含 50-100 根骨骼。</p>\n<p><strong>绑定核心概念</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>蒙皮权重（Skin Weights）</strong>：定义每个顶点受哪些骨骼影响及其比重。权重刷涂是绑定中最耗时的手工环节。</li>\n<li><strong>IK/FK 切换</strong>：正向运动学（FK）从父到子逐级旋转；反向运动学（IK）从末端位置反推整条链的姿态。行走用 IK，手势表演用 FK。</li>\n<li><strong>约束系统</strong>：Look At 约束（眼球追踪）、Pole Vector（膝盖朝向）、Space Switching（世界/局部空间切换）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>动画十二法则</strong>（Disney 经典动画原则在三维中的应用）：\n挤压与拉伸（Squash &amp; Stretch）、预备动作（Anticipation）、弧线运动（Arcs）、缓入缓出（Ease In/Out）、跟随与重叠（Follow-through &amp; Overlapping）等——这些原则在三维关键帧动画中同样是生动表演的基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"渲染基础\">渲染基础</h3><p>从三维场景到最终图像的计算过程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>光线追踪（Ray Tracing）</strong>：模拟光线在场景中的弹射行为，计算精确的反射、折射和阴影。每像素发射数百条光线求解辐射度方程。</li>\n<li><strong>实时渲染 vs 离线渲染</strong>：游戏引擎（Unity/UE）使用光栅化+实时光追混合方案，帧率 30-120fps；电影渲染器（Arnold/RenderMan）追求物理精确度，单帧可能渲染数分钟至数小时。</li>\n<li><strong>渲染方程</strong>（简化形式）：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_o(p, \\omega_o) = L_e(p, \\omega_o) + \\int_\\Omega f_r(p, \\omega_i, \\omega_o) L_i(p, \\omega_i) (\\omega_i \\cdot n) \\, d\\omega_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2719em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.4336em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Ω</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" sty