\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为出射辐射度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为自发光，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 BRDF（双向反射分布函数），积分覆盖半球 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 上所有入射方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025—2026年，AI 驱动的三维生成技术取得重大突破。文生3D 模型工具（如 OpenAI 的 Shap-E 后续版本、Meshy AI、Tripo3D）已能在数秒内生成可用的3D网格，虽然拓扑质量仍不及手工建模，但在概念阶段和场景填充中已具备实用价值。</p>\n<p>Blender 4.x 系列引入了节点式几何体（Geometry Nodes）的重大升级，程序化建模能力直逼 Houdini。加之其开源免费的优势，Blender 在教育和独立创作领域的市场份额持续扩大。</p>\n<p>运动捕捉（Motion Capture）技术的平民化也值得关注：iPhone 的 ARKit 面部捕捉、Move.ai 的无标记全身动捕仅需普通视频即可提取高质量动画数据，大幅降低了角色动画的生产门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在 Blender 中完成一个完整的硬表面建模练习：选择一个日常物品（耳机/手表/相机），从参考图出发完成建模→UV→材质→简单灯光→渲染的全流程。记录面数、渲染时间和关键建模决策。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>创建一个简单的人形角色低模（&lt;5000面），完成骨骼绑定和蒙皮权重绘制。测试行走循环动画，确保膝盖、肘部的变形自然无撕裂。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 Substance Painter 为你的模型制作一套完整的 PBR 贴图集（Base Color + Normal + Metallic + Roughness + AO），分辨率不低于 2K。在 UE 或 Blender EEVEE 中实时预览效果。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>制作一段5秒的角色动画（如跳跃或挥手），严格遵循&quot;预备—动作—恢复&quot;的三段式结构，运用挤压拉伸和缓入缓出原则。渲染输出并自我评估动画表演的生动程度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 Blender Cycles（路径追踪）与 EEVEE（实时渲染）在同一场景下的渲染质量差异。从光影精度、反射效果、渲染时间三个维度撰写对比报告。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>三维建模与动画是数字媒体艺术中技术门槛最高、产出最直观的方向之一。从坐标系数学到拓扑美学，从PBR材质的物理基础到角色表演的艺术直觉，这是一个深度融合理性思维与感性创造的领域。工具在持续进化，但对形态比例的审美、对运动节奏的感知、对材质质感的观察力——这些核心素养不会被 AI 工具取代，反而随着技术进步而愈加珍贵。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三维建模与动画","id":"三维建模与动画"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"三维建模基础概念","id":"三维建模基础概念"},{"level":3,"text":"拓扑与UV展开","id":"拓扑与uv展开"},{"level":3,"text":"材质与贴图系统","id":"材质与贴图系统"},{"level":3,"text":"骨骼绑定与角色动画","id":"骨骼绑定与角色动画"},{"level":3,"text":"渲染基础","id":"渲染基础"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"视听语言与叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation/film-language-narrative"},"next":{"title":"后期特效与合成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/digital-media-arts/film-animation-creation/vfx-compositing"}}